{"format":"revizio-pack","version":1,"courses":[{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Nombres relatifs et fractions","title":"Nombres relatifs et fractions","duration":30,"summary":"Opérations sur les nombres relatifs; les quatre opérations sur les fractions; fractions irréductibles.","objectives":["Additionner et soustraire des relatifs","Multiplier et diviser des relatifs","Calculer avec des fractions et les simplifier"],"prerequisites":["Relatifs et fractions de 5e"],"pitfalls":["Oublier la règle des signes","Additionner les dénominateurs"],"lesson":[{"title":"Opérations sur les relatifs","content":"Additionner un relatif revient à avancer ou reculer sur la droite. Soustraire, c'est ajouter l'opposé : a − b = a + (−b). Produit et quotient : deux nombres de même signe donnent un résultat positif; de signes contraires, négatif.","examples":["(−3) + 5 = 2","4 − 7 = −3","(−2) × (−6) = 12","(−12) ÷ 3 = −4"]},{"title":"Fractions","content":"Additionner : même dénominateur, puis on additionne les numérateurs (1/5 + 3/5 = 4/5). Multiplier : numérateurs entre eux et dénominateurs entre eux (2/3 × 4/5 = 8/15). Diviser par une fraction, c'est multiplier par son inverse (2/3 ÷ 4/5 = 2/3 × 5/4 = 10/12 = 5/6).","examples":["1/2 + 1/3 = 3/6 + 2/6 = 5/6"]},{"title":"Fraction irréductible","content":"Une fraction est irréductible quand on ne peut plus la simplifier. On divise numérateur et dénominateur par leur PGCD (plus grand diviseur commun).","examples":["12/18 = 2/3 (÷ 6)"]}],"keyPoints":["Même signe : + ; signes contraires : −","a − b = a + (−b)","Diviser = multiplier par l'inverse","Simplifier avec le PGCD"],"cards":[{"q":"(−3) × (−4) =","a":"12","explain":"Même signe : positif.","tag":""},{"q":"(−3) × 4 =","a":"−12","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"(−6) ÷ (−2) =","a":"3","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Comment soustraire un relatif ?","a":"On ajoute son opposé","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Comment multiplier deux fractions ?","a":"Numérateurs entre eux, dénominateurs entre eux","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Comment diviser par une fraction ?","a":"On multiplie par son inverse","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Qu'est-ce qu'une fraction irréductible ?","a":"Une fraction qu'on ne peut plus simplifier","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Simplifier 12/18","a":"2/3 (÷ 6)","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"(−3) + 5 =","answer":"2","explanation":"On avance de 5 depuis −3.","level":1,"skill":"addition","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"4 − 7 =","answer":"-3","explanation":"4 + (−7).","level":1,"skill":"soustraction","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"(−2) × (−6) =","answer":"12","explanation":"Même signe.","level":1,"skill":"produit","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"(−12) ÷ 3 =","answer":"-4","explanation":"Signes contraires.","level":1,"skill":"quotient","hint":""},{"type":"qcm","q":"Quel est le résultat de 1/2 + 1/3 ?","choices":["2/5","5/6","1/6","2/6"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Dénominateur commun 6 : 3/6 + 2/6.","level":2,"skill":"fractions"},{"type":"short","q":"Calcule 2/3 × 4/5.","answer":"8/15","accept":[],"explanation":"2×4 et 3×5.","level":2,"skill":"fractions"},{"type":"short","q":"Simplifie 12/18.","answer":"2/3","accept":[],"explanation":"PGCD = 6.","level":2,"skill":"simplifier"},{"type":"vf","q":"(−5) × (−5) est négatif.","answer":false,"explanation":"Même signe : +25.","level":1,"skill":"signes"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Puissances","title":"Puissances","duration":25,"summary":"Puissances entières, puissances de 10, notation scientifique.","objectives":["Calculer une puissance","Utiliser les règles des puissances de 10","Écrire en notation scientifique"],"prerequisites":["Multiplication"],"pitfalls":["a² ≠ 2a","Mélanger les règles"],"lesson":[{"title":"Définition","content":"aⁿ = a × a × … × a (n facteurs). a⁰ = 1 ; a¹ = a. a⁻ⁿ = 1/aⁿ.","examples":["2³ = 8","10⁻² = 0,01","(−3)² = 9, −3² = −9"]},{"title":"Règles","content":"aᵐ × aⁿ = aᵐ⁺ⁿ ; aᵐ ÷ aⁿ = aᵐ⁻ⁿ ; (aᵐ)ⁿ = aᵐˣⁿ.","examples":["10⁴ × 10³ = 10⁷","(10²)³ = 10⁶"]},{"title":"Notation scientifique","content":"Un nombre s'écrit a × 10ⁿ avec 1 ≤ a < 10.","examples":["45 000 = 4,5 × 10⁴","0,0003 = 3 × 10⁻⁴"]}],"keyPoints":["a⁰ = 1","10⁻ⁿ = 0,0…1","Exposants : on additionne pour ×","Notation scientifique : 1 ≤ a < 10"],"cards":[{"q":"2³ =","a":"8","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"5² =","a":"25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10³ =","a":"1 000","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10⁻² =","a":"0,01","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"a⁰ =","a":"1","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"10⁴ × 10³ =","a":"10⁷","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"45 000 en notation scientifique","a":"4,5 × 10⁴","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Que vaut (−3)² ?","a":"9","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"2³ =","answer":"8","explanation":"2 × 2 × 2.","level":1,"skill":"puissance","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"5² =","answer":"25","explanation":"5 × 5.","level":1,"skill":"puissance","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"10³ =","answer":"1000","explanation":"Trois zéros.","level":1,"skill":"puissance 10","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"10⁰ =","answer":"1","explanation":"a⁰ = 1.","level":1,"skill":"puissance","hint":""},{"type":"qcm","q":"10⁴ × 10³ =","choices":["10⁷","10¹²","100⁷","20⁷"],"answer":0,"explanation":"4 + 3.","level":1,"skill":"règles"},{"type":"qcm","q":"45 000 =","choices":["4,5 × 10⁴","45 × 10⁴","0,45 × 10⁴","4,5 × 10³"],"answer":0,"explanation":"1 ≤ a < 10.","level":2,"skill":"scientifique"},{"type":"vf","q":"2³ = 6","answer":false,"explanation":"2 × 2 × 2 = 8.","level":1,"skill":"puissance"},{"type":"short","q":"Écris 0,0003 en notation scientifique.","answer":"3 × 10⁻⁴","accept":["3x10^-4","3 × 10^-4","3×10⁻⁴"],"explanation":"Quatre rangs.","level":3,"skill":"scientifique"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Calcul littéral","title":"Calcul littéral","duration":30,"summary":"Développer, réduire, simple distributivité, tester une égalité.","objectives":["Réduire une expression","Développer k(a + b)","Tester une égalité"],"prerequisites":["Opérations"],"pitfalls":["Oublier de multiplier tous les termes","Confondre 2x et x²"],"lesson":[{"title":"Réduire","content":"On regroupe les termes de même nature : 3x + 5x = 8x ; 2x + 3 − x + 4 = x + 7.","examples":["3x + 5x = 8x"]},{"title":"Distributivité","content":"k × (a + b) = k × a + k × b et k × (a − b) = k × a − k × b.","examples":["3(x + 2) = 3x + 6","−2(x − 4) = −2x + 8"]},{"title":"Tester une égalité","content":"On remplace la lettre par la valeur et on compare les deux membres.","examples":["x = 2 : 3x + 1 = 7 est vraie car 3 × 2 + 1 = 7"]}],"keyPoints":["Réduire : mêmes termes","Distribuer à tous les termes","Tester en remplaçant"],"cards":[{"q":"Réduis 3x + 5x","a":"8x","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Développe 3(x + 2)","a":"3x + 6","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Développe 2(x − 5)","a":"2x − 10","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Développe −2(x − 4)","a":"−2x + 8","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Réduis x + x + x","a":"3x","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Que fait-on pour tester une égalité ?","a":"On remplace la lettre par la valeur","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"x² c'est…","a":"x × x","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"2x c'est…","a":"2 × x","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"short","q":"Réduis 3x + 5x.","answer":"8x","accept":[],"explanation":"3 + 5.","level":1,"skill":"réduire"},{"type":"short","q":"Développe 3(x + 2).","answer":"3x + 6","accept":["3x+6"],"explanation":"Distributivité.","level":1,"skill":"développer"},{"type":"short","q":"Développe 2(x − 5).","answer":"2x − 10","accept":["2x-10"],"explanation":"Distributivité.","level":2,"skill":"développer"},{"type":"short","q":"Développe −2(x − 4).","answer":"−2x + 8","accept":["-2x+8","-2x + 8"],"explanation":"Signes.","level":3,"skill":"développer"},{"type":"calcul","q":"Pour x = 2, calcule 3x + 1.","answer":"7","explanation":"3 × 2 + 1.","level":1,"skill":"tester","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"x² est égal à 2x.","answer":false,"explanation":"x² = x × x.","level":1,"skill":"notation"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Que vaut 4x − x ?","choices":["4","3x","5x","3"],"answer":1,"explanation":"4x − 1x.","level":1,"skill":"réduire"},{"type":"assoc","q":"Relie chaque expression à sa forme développée.","pairs":[["2(x+1)","2x+2"],["3(x−2)","3x−6"],["4(x+5)","4x+20"]],"explanation":"Distributivité.","level":2,"skill":"développer"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Équations du premier degré","title":"Équations du premier degré","duration":30,"summary":"Résoudre une équation et mettre un problème en équation.","objectives":["Résoudre ax + b = c","Mettre en équation","Vérifier la solution"],"prerequisites":["Calcul littéral"],"pitfalls":["Oublier de changer de signe","Ne pas vérifier"],"lesson":[{"title":"Résoudre","content":"On garde l'égalité en faisant la même opération des deux côtés. 2x + 3 = 11 → 2x = 8 → x = 4.","examples":["3x − 5 = 10 → 3x = 15 → x = 5"]},{"title":"Mettre en équation","content":"1) Choisir l'inconnue. 2) Écrire l'équation. 3) Résoudre. 4) Vérifier et conclure.","examples":["Un nombre multiplié par 3 puis augmenté de 2 donne 14 : 3x + 2 = 14, x = 4"]},{"title":"Vérifier","content":"On remplace x par la solution : si les deux membres sont égaux, c'est bon.","examples":["x = 4 : 2 × 4 + 3 = 11 ✓"]}],"keyPoints":["Même opération des deux côtés","Isoler x","Toujours vérifier"],"cards":[{"q":"Résous 2x = 8","a":"x = 4","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Résous x + 5 = 12","a":"x = 7","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Résous 3x − 5 = 10","a":"x = 5","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Qu'est-ce qu'une équation ?","a":"Une égalité avec une inconnue","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Étape 1 d'un problème ?","a":"Choisir l'inconnue","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Comment vérifier ?","a":"Remplacer x par la solution","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Résous x − 3 = 4","a":"x = 7","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Résous 4x = 0","a":"x = 0","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"Résous 2x + 3 = 11 : x =","answer":"4","explanation":"2x = 8.","level":1,"skill":"résoudre","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Résous x + 5 = 12 : x =","answer":"7","explanation":"12 − 5.","level":1,"skill":"résoudre","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Résous 3x − 5 = 10 : x =","answer":"5","explanation":"3x = 15.","level":2,"skill":"résoudre","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Résous 5x = 20 : x =","answer":"4","explanation":"20 ÷ 5.","level":1,"skill":"résoudre","hint":""},{"type":"qcm","q":"Un nombre multiplié par 3 puis augmenté de 2 donne 14. Quelle équation ?","choices":["3x + 2 = 14","3 + 2x = 14","x + 5 = 14","3x = 14"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Mise en équation.","level":2,"skill":"équation"},{"type":"vf","q":"x = 4 est solution de 2x + 3 = 11.","answer":true,"explanation":"2 × 4 + 3 = 11.","level":1,"skill":"vérifier"},{"type":"calcul","q":"Quel est le nombre : son double plus 7 vaut 25 ?","answer":"9","explanation":"2x + 7 = 25.","level":2,"skill":"problème","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"On peut ajouter un nombre d'un seul côté.","answer":false,"explanation":"Des deux côtés.","level":1,"skill":"règle"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Théorème de Pythagore","title":"Théorème de Pythagore","duration":30,"summary":"Calcul d'une longueur, réciproque, triangle rectangle.","objectives":["Calculer une longueur","Savoir démontrer qu'un triangle est rectangle"],"prerequisites":["Puissances, racines"],"pitfalls":["Oublier de mettre au carré","Se tromper d'hypoténuse"],"lesson":[{"title":"Énoncé","content":"Dans un triangle rectangle, le carré de l'hypoténuse (côté opposé à l'angle droit) est égal à la somme des carrés des deux autres côtés : BC² = AB² + AC².","examples":["Triangle 3, 4, 5 : 5² = 3² + 4²"]},{"title":"Calculer une longueur","content":"Hypoténuse : on additionne les carrés puis on prend la racine. Côté : on soustrait.","examples":["Cathètes 6 et 8 : hypoténuse = √100 = 10"]},{"title":"Réciproque","content":"Si le carré du plus grand côté est égal à la somme des carrés des deux autres, alors le triangle est rectangle.","examples":["5² = 25 = 9 + 16 → triangle rectangle"]}],"keyPoints":["Hypoténuse = plus grand côté","BC² = AB² + AC²","Réciproque pour prouver"],"cards":[{"q":"Hypoténuse ?","a":"Côté opposé à l'angle droit","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Énoncé de Pythagore","a":"BC² = AB² + AC²","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"3² + 4² =","a":"25","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"√25 =","a":"5","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Triangle de côtés 3, 4, 5 ?","a":"Rectangle","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Triplet 5, 12, 13 ?","a":"Rectangle","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Réciproque ?","a":"Si BC² = AB² + AC², le triangle est rectangle","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Quand utiliser Pythagore ?","a":"Dans un triangle rectangle","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"Cathètes 6 et 8 : hypoténuse =","answer":"10","explanation":"6² + 8² = 100.","level":1,"skill":"hypoténuse","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Hypoténuse 13, un côté 5 : l'autre côté =","answer":"12","explanation":"169 − 25 = 144.","level":2,"skill":"côté","hint":""},{"type":"calcul","q":"Cathètes 3 et 4 : hypoténuse =","answer":"5","explanation":"9 + 16 = 25.","level":1,"skill":"hypoténuse","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"L'hypoténuse est le plus grand côté.","answer":true,"explanation":"Oui.","level":1,"skill":"définition"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Un triangle de côtés 5, 12, 13 est…","choices":["rectangle","équilatéral","isocèle","impossible"],"answer":0,"explanation":"169 = 25 + 144.","level":2,"skill":"réciproque"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Un triangle de côtés 4, 5, 6 est-il rectangle ?","choices":["Oui","Non","On ne peut pas savoir","Seulement isocèle"],"answer":1,"explanation":"36 ≠ 16 + 25.","level":3,"skill":"réciproque"},{"type":"trous","q":"Dans un triangle rectangle, le carré de l'___ est égal à la somme des carrés des deux autres côtés.","answer":"hypoténuse","accept":["hypotenuse"],"explanation":"Énoncé.","level":1,"skill":"énoncé"},{"type":"vf","q":"Pythagore s'applique à tous les triangles.","answer":false,"explanation":"Triangle rectangle.","level":1,"skill":"énoncé"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Théorème de Thalès (introduction)","title":"Théorème de Thalès (introduction)","duration":30,"summary":"Proportionnalité de longueurs, triangles semblables, configurations.","objectives":["Reconnaître une configuration de Thalès","Calculer une longueur"],"prerequisites":["Proportionnalité"],"pitfalls":["Mauvais rapport","Oublier le parallélisme"],"lesson":[{"title":"Énoncé","content":"Si deux droites (BC) et (DE) sont parallèles et que A, B, D et A, C, E sont alignés, alors AB/AD = AC/AE = BC/DE.","examples":["Triangles emboîtés"]},{"title":"Configurations","content":"Triangles emboîtés ou « papillon ».","examples":["Papillon : sommet commun"]},{"title":"Calculer","content":"On écrit les rapports égaux et on calcule un produit en croix.","examples":["AB/AD = AC/AE : 2/6 = 3/AE → AE = 9"]}],"keyPoints":["Parallèles nécessaires","Rapports égaux","Produit en croix"],"cards":[{"q":"Condition de Thalès ?","a":"Deux droites parallèles","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Rapports égaux","a":"AB/AD = AC/AE = BC/DE","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Configuration emboîtée ?","a":"Deux triangles imbriqués","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Configuration papillon ?","a":"Deux triangles opposés par le sommet","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Produit en croix ?","a":"a/b = c/d → ad = bc","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Triangles semblables ?","a":"Mêmes angles, côtés proportionnels","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Thalès sert à…","a":"Calculer des longueurs","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"Sans parallèles ?","a":"On ne peut pas appliquer Thalès","explain":"","tag":""}],"questions":[{"type":"calcul","q":"AB/AD = 2/6 = 3/AE : AE =","answer":"9","explanation":"6 × 3 ÷ 2.","level":2,"skill":"calcul","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"Thalès s'applique sans droites parallèles.","answer":false,"explanation":"Parallèles requis.","level":1,"skill":"condition"},{"type":"qcm","q":"Quelle égalité est vraie ?","choices":["AB/AD = AC/AE","AB/AC = AD/AE","AB × AD = AC × AE","AB + AD = AC + AE"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Rapports égaux.","level":2,"skill":"rapports"},{"type":"calcul","q":"Rapport de 4 sur 8 =","answer":"0.5","explanation":"4 ÷ 8.","level":1,"skill":"rapport","hint":""},{"type":"trous","q":"Si BC // DE, alors AB/AD = AC/AE = ___/DE.","answer":"BC","accept":[],"explanation":"Rapport des côtés.","level":2,"skill":"rapports"},{"type":"assoc","q":"Relie chaque configuration à sa description.","pairs":[["Emboîtées","triangles dans un autre"],["Papillon","sommet commun opposé"]],"explanation":"Configurations.","level":2,"skill":"configurations"},{"type":"calcul","q":"Si AB/AD = 1/3 et AD = 12, AB =","answer":"4","explanation":"12 ÷ 3.","level":2,"skill":"calcul","hint":""},{"type":"vf","q":"Le produit en croix permet de calculer une longueur inconnue.","answer":true,"explanation":"Oui.","level":1,"skill":"méthode"}]},{"level":"4e","subject":"maths","catalogTitle":"Proportionnalité, vitesse, pourcentages","title":"Proportionnalité, vitesse, pourcentages","duration":30,"summary":"Coefficient, fonctions linéaires simples, vitesse, pourcentage d'évolution.","objectives":["Calculer avec un coefficient","Calculer une vitesse","Calculer des pourcentages d'évolution"],"prerequisites":["Proportionnalité"],"pitfalls":["Se tromper d'unités","Pourcentages successifs"],"lesson":[{"title":"Coefficient et linéaire","content":"y = ax : a est le coefficient. Le graphique est une droite passant par l'origine.","examples":["y = 3x : x=4 → y=12"]},{"title":"Vitesse","content":"v = d ÷ t ; d = v × t ; t = d ÷ v. 1 m/s = 3,6 km/h.","examples":["90 km en 1,5 h : 60 km/h"]},{"title":"Pourcentage d'évolution","content":"Augmenter de 20 % = multiplier par 1,2. Diminuer de 20 % = multiplier par 0,8.","examples":["Prix 50 € +20 % = 60 €"]}],"keyPoints":["y = ax","v = d/t","+t % → ×(1 + t/100)"],"cards":[{"q":"Fonction linéaire ?","a":"y = ax","explain":"","tag":""},{"q":"v =","a":"d ÷ t","explain":""